      "config": {
        "content": "## Cisco IOS Switch Monitoring\nHealth overview for Cisco IOS switches polled via SNMP (`metrics-snmp.polling-infra`). Includes CPU/memory trends, interface traffic and error trends, and a per-port health grid below. Use the controls to filter by switch or port status.",
